# Chog Genesis NFT Access Gate Configuration
# Monad Mainnet Chain ID: 143
# Contract: 0xc96d31F8626c6D03Fae5dCD3d61e3FB9F4a73763

# Comma-separated list of creator addresses granted access without owning an NFT.
# Compared case-insensitively. NEVER commit real addresses here.
